Note: Due to the flash layout of v1 (and probably v2) the firmware partition is only 6016 KiB in size. This is not enough for the standard OpenWrt-22.03 image. It's still possible to install 22.03 by creating a smaller image using [[docs:guide-user:additional-software:imagebuilder|ImageBuilder]] or [[https://firmware-selector.openwrt.org/|Firmware Selector]]

